  "title": "EV charging detection — synthetic dataset for the H3 hands-on lab",
  "description": "Synthetic European EV telematics, charging stations and ABC Corp's internal charging sessions. Used to demonstrate H3 as a blocking key for a stop-to-station cross join, against a haversine baseline. ABC Corp, its competitors, all vehicles, headings and sessions are invented; only the city coordinates the data is seeded around are real.",
